{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2022-03-11 08:00:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION ANNOUNCES ELECTION OF KELLY C. CHAMBLISS TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND DECLARES QUARTERLY DISTRIBUTION', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION (NYSE: AMT) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED KELLY C. CHAMBLISS AS A DIRECTOR. MS. CHAMBLISS IS THE SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER OF IBM CONSULTING. MS. CHAMBLISS WAS PREVIOUSLY SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF IBM CONSULTING, AMERICAS AND STRATEGIC SALES, AND HAS SERVED IN VARIOUS OTHER SENIOR LEADERSHIP ROLES AT IBM SINCE LATE 2002, INCLUDING AS THE CHIEF TECHNOLOGY OFFICER FOR IBM GLOBAL BUSINESS SERVICES (GBS)'}